We have shown that adding a Cluster to a ***String-Cluster***, such that the resulting system remains a ***String-Cluster***, increases the number of accessible hysteresis states by exactly 3. Combined with the base case (*n* = 1, four hysteresis states), it follows by induction that every ***M****-* ***String-Cluster*** system has exactly *“****n+3=2M+3****”* accessible hysteresis states, where ***M****= number of Clusters,* ***n*** *number of Microrobots* and ***M=n/2***.

